<title>FINLAND: BUILDERS UP R.KONEVUOKRAAMO STAKE.</title>
<headline>BUILDERS UP R.KONEVUOKRAAMO STAKE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction equipment leasing company Rakentajain Konevuokraamo Oy said on Wednesday that the Builder Foundation's stake in it has increased to above one fifth of shares.</p>
<p>Currently the Builders' Foundation has 20.3 percent of Rakentajain Konevuokraamo shares and 39.9 percent of votes, Rakentajain Konevuokraamo said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
